，出声问：“这凡丫头怎么跟以前给人的感觉不一样了，以前的她生性怯弱，看人时都低垂着头，说话也是轻言细语的，跟眼前这个浑身充满自信的丫头联系不起来呀。”小的那个，注视了前方片刻后，淡淡的说：“许是摔坏脑袋了。”老的那个沉思了片刻后，点点头道：“的确是有可能，从那么高的悬崖上摔下来，要不是遇到你，恐怕此刻已经死无全尸了吧。”小的那个在听到这句话后，稚嫩的脸上浮现出几许怒容。老的那个见状，浅笑着闭上了嘴。“小凡，你这是干什么？”孟氏伸手将四喜护在身后，沉下脸，对着苏小凡吼。苏小凡眸间寒光闪现，唇角勾起森冷的笑意：“你们别以为厨子手中的刀，就只会切菜，切切人头什么的也是轻而易举的事儿哦…”说完，加快了手上的动作，那把刀转动的速度已经快得让他人看不清了。现场鸦雀无声，四喜战战兢兢的躲在自己娘身后，小小声的说：“这苏小凡是不是受刺激过度，疯了？”闻言，院中的人对视了一眼，而后都恨不得自己多生出几条腿一般，纷纷逃离现场，不远处传来苏二夫粗犷的声音：“别以为威胁我们就不要你们还钱了，过几日我们还会来的。”待众人都离去后，叶氏跟贾氏纷纷起身，走到苏小凡身旁，担忧的看着她。苏小凡咧嘴一笑：“奶奶，娘，你们别担心，我没事儿。”“哦，没事就好。”贾氏松了口气，看到刚刚那么陌生的凡儿，她还真的担心这孩子是不是受刺激过度了。远处的一老一小，看着落荒而逃的众人，不由得都笑了出来。而后小的那个挥手叫老的弯下身子，在他耳边耳语了几句。老的不可置信的问：“真要如此？”小的坚定的点了点头。“那好，咱们过去吧。”老的伸出手，牵上小的，迈着稳重的步伐朝小院子走去。这边门口的三人，正欲进屋，听到身后的动静，纷纷转身。“村长，怎么过来了。”叶氏抬手擦了擦脸，害怕脸上还残留着泪痕什么的，让人看笑话。“其实今日过来，是为了我家小孙子来的。”萧长富用手指着自己身旁的小小少年。三人的目光都顺着他的手看去，而后皆吃惊不已，在这乡下地方，极少看到如此漂亮的小娃娃，那水盈盈的黑眸，肤白脸嫩，身穿白衫，墨色的发丝用一根银簪绾起，不知长大后，会变成怎样的俊俏模样。叶氏最先反应过来，问：“村长家的儿子早些年就出去经商了，怎会突然将小孙子送回来？”萧长富捋着胡须笑道：“说是生意太忙了，照顾不到这孩子。”“那么不知村长刚说的是何事？”叶氏身子微僵，按理说这个时候要邀请他们去屋内坐坐的，但是家里实在寒酸了，连张能坐的椅子都没有，早在前个月那些个物件都被那两个没良知的畜生拿走了。萧长富再度用眼神询问了一次身旁的小小人，得到肯定的回答后才开口说：“是这样的，这孩子体弱，想找个人伺候他。”叶氏与贾氏对望一眼，眼下家里着实没人能去他家帮忙照顾那小孙子，自家都是自顾不暇了。思索了片刻，叶氏才又说道：“村长不介意的话，等凡儿身子好些了，可以去你家帮忙照看小少爷。”“不，你们误会了，我要找的不是丫鬟。”萧长富依旧捋着胡须，笑的意味深长。贾氏拧眉，如果不是找丫鬟，那么是要？“眼下你家凡丫头跟张家孩子的婚约已经解除了，我想让凡丫头到我家做童养媳，待我孙儿长大后再成亲。”萧长富淡定的说完，如预料那般，面前的三人都被他的话吓到了，还吓的不轻。“童养媳？”苏小凡伸手掏掏自己的耳朵，生怕刚刚自己是听错了。“是啊，村长您是不是在说笑，这凡儿都已经十五岁了，如何去做童养媳？何况您家小孙子这才五六岁吧……”贾氏疑问出声，村中也有不少人将家中的女孩子送去别人家当童养媳的，但是自己膝下就凡儿一个，以前不管日子过的多艰苦，也没想过让她去做童养媳。萧长富依旧挂着云淡风轻的笑，低声说：“你们家现在的情况不乐观吧，没有收入来源，你娘的身子不好，大妹子你也眼看着就要生产了，凡丫头眼下身子也还需要调理，如果凡丫头到我们家做童养媳，我可以给你们一笔银子，暂度眼下的难关。”闻言，叶氏混沌的老眼中闪过愠怒，沉声道：“即便家里穷，也不需要卖人来度过难关。”－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－新文，求收，求评，总之各种求~！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 3 \"Sister, go inside the house and see if they have hidden anything.\" Su Siqing, who was carrying a bag of things, said to his sister Su Sixi. \"Okay.\" Su Sixi raised her feet with some displeasure and prepared to walk in. She had already agreed with her mother that if she could get some money today, she would make herself new clothes. It seemed that there was no hope of getting new clothes today. When he walked to the door, he saw Su Xiaofan coming out of the house with a kitchen knife. He was looking at him expressionlessly. He stopped and looked at Su Xiaofan like a monster. He taunted: \"Su Xiaofan, brother Yunsong doesn't want you anymore. If it were me, I would just die. You still have the nerve to come out and embarrass yourself.\" Hearing this, Su Xiaofan still looked at her expressionlessly. Isn't it just a break from the engagement? Why do you want to live and die? Ancient thoughts were of no use in her modern mind. Su Xiaofan held the kitchen knife and blocked it in the middle of the door, lazily playing with the broken kitchen knife in his hand. Everyone in the courtyard watched the broken knife spinning back and forth in her hand, as fast as a street performer performing a juggling act. They couldn't help but feel fear, fearing that the kitchen knife would fly to someone in the courtyard without paying attention. \"Si Xi, come here first.\" Meng called Su Sixi back worriedly. She was so close. What if Su Xiaofan flew the knife towards her like crazy? At this time, two people, an old man and a young man, were standing outside the courtyard not far away. The older one looked worried, looked at the younger one next to him, and asked aloud: \"Why is this girl different from how she used to be? In the past, she was timid by nature. She lowered her head when looking at people, and spoke softly. She couldn't relate to the confident girl in front of her.\" The younger one looked at the front. After a moment, Fang said calmly: \"Perhaps he broke his head.\" After pondering for a moment, the older one nodded and said, \"It is indeed possible. If he fell from such a high cliff, if I hadn't met you, I would have been dead by now.\" After hearing this, the younger one's childish face showed a bit of anger. Seeing this, the old man smiled and closed his mouth. \"Xiaofan, what are you doing?\" Meng stretched out her hand to protect Sixi behind her, lowered her face, and shouted at Su Xiaofan. A cold light flashed in Su Xiaofan's eyes, and a cold smile appeared on the corner of his lips: \"Don't think that the knife in the cook's hand is only for cutting vegetables. It is also easy to cut human heads...\" After saying that, he sped up the movement of his hand, and the knife rotated so fast that others could not see clearly. The scene was completely silent. Si Xi hid behind her mother tremblingly, and whispered: \"Is Su Xiaofan over-stimulated and crazy?\" Hearing this, the people in the courtyard looked at each other, and then they all ran away as if they wished they had more legs. Not far away from the scene, Su Erfu's rough voice came: \"Don't think that threatening us will stop you from paying back the money. We will come back in a few days.\" After everyone left, Mr. Ye and Ms. Jia stood up and walked to Su Xiaofan, looking at her worriedly. Su Xiaofan grinned: \"Grandma, mother, don't worry, I'm fine.\" \"Oh, it's fine.\" Jia Shi breathed a sigh of relief. Seeing Fan'er who was so unfamiliar just now, she was really worried that the child was overstimulated. The old man and the young man in the distance couldn't help but laugh when they looked at the people fleeing. Then the younger one waved and asked the older one to bend down and whisper a few words in his ear. The old man asked in disbelief: \"Is this really true?\" The young man nodded firmly. \"Okay, let's go there.\" The old man stretched out his hand, took the young man's hand, and walked towards the small yard with steady steps. The three people at the door here were about to enter the house when they heard the movement behind them and turned around. \"Village Chief, why are you here?\" Ye raised his hand and wiped his face, fearing that there were still tears on his face and making others laugh. \"Actually, I came here today because of my little grandson.\" Xiao Changfu pointed at the little boy beside him. The three people's eyes followed his hand, and they were all surprised. It was rare to see such a beautiful little baby in this rural place, with watery black eyes, fair skin and tender face. She was wearing a white shirt, and her dark hair was tied up with a silver hairpin. I wonder how handsome she will become when she grows up. Ye was the first to react and asked: \"The village chief's son went out to do business a few years ago. How could he suddenly send his grandson back?\" Xiao Changfu stroked his beard and said with a smile, \"It's because the business was too busy and he couldn't take care of the child.\" \"Then I don't know what the village chief just said. \"What's going on?\" Ms. Ye's body was slightly stiff. Normally, she would have invited them to sit in the house at this time, but the house was really shabby and there was not even a chair that could be used to sit on. Those two unscrupulous beasts had taken away those items as early as the month before. Xiao Changfu once again asked the little man next to him with his eyes. After receiving a positive answer, he said, \"That's it. This child is frail and I want someone to take care of him.\" Mrs. Ye and Mrs. Jia looked at each other. At the moment, no one in the family could go to his house to help take care of the little grandson. They were too busy taking care of themselves. After thinking for a moment, Mrs. Ye said again: \"If you don't mind, village chief, when Fan'er gets better, I can go to your house to help take care of the young master.\" \"No, you misunderstood, I'm not looking for a maid.\" Xiao Changfu still stroked his beard and smiled meaningfully. Mrs. Jia frowned, if not looking for a maid, then what? \"Now the engagement between your Fan girl and the Zhang family's children has been terminated. I want Fan girl to come to my house to be a child bride, and we will get married when my grandson grows up.\" Xiao Changfu finished speaking calmly. As expected, the three people in front of him were frightened by his words, and they were quite frightened. \"Child bride?\" Su Xiaofan reached out and dug out his ears, fearing that he had heard wrongly. \"Yes, village chief, you", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}